<title>USA: Cardinal Bancshares Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cardinal Bancshares Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			    438			234</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,695		    1,555</p>
<p>			 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.79		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			  4,667			945</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,584		    1,425</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and nine month periods include $479,000 after tax assessment related to deposit insurance.</p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes a $4.6 million gain on the sale of Cardinal Credit Corp and $981,000 in losses at Security First Network Bank prior to the spinoff to shareholders on May 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets at Sept 30: $615.0 milion vs $654.2 million.</p>
<p>Total loans at Sept 30: $460.9 million vs $453.8 million.</p>
<p>Total deposits at Sept 30: $533.3 million vs $559.7 million.</p>
